            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1615] Zeppelin should be able to run without Shiro</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1615</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Right now, Zeppelin use Shiro by default even if you dont need it.&lt;br/&gt;
(It will use shiro.ini.template file if it doenst find shiro.ini), this behaviors is a little flacky and we should start zeppelin without shiro context if user doenst want to use it&lt;/p&gt;</description>
